summary:
  The picture sent to a cast device is the one on the Playing page, not
  the song's own cover.

history:
  A television keeps the picture it was sent beside the title for as long
  as the song plays, and has no line to say it is another record's sleeve.
  _castArt hands CastLogic.picture the song's own cover or nothing, which
  leaves the station's logo. This mutant hands it whatever picture there is.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          return CastLogic.picture(isPod ? _podPlayingArt : "", trackArtUrl, currentStationFavicon);

replace:
          return CastLogic.picture(isPod ? _podPlayingArt : "", albumArtUrl, currentStationFavicon);

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_picture_a_device_is_sent_is_chosen_in_one_place.
  Line-neutral.
